# ============================================================
# JOB SCHEDULING ENGINE — SUPPORT DOCUMENT
# ============================================================
# This engine manages the global job queue for the system. It
# ensures fair, deterministic scheduling of tasks across modules.
#
# RESPONSIBILITIES:
#   - Accept new jobs
#   - Timestamp jobs
#   - Maintain FIFO execution order
#   - Track scheduled and executed counts
#
# Used by:
#   - Load Balancer Engine
#   - Pipeline Execution Engine
#   - Orchestrator
